              <a href="#steps" class="text-sm text-gray-600 hover:text-[#1E90FF] no-underline py-1 font-medium">2. Step-by-Step Application Guide</a>
              <a href="#mistakes" class="text-sm text-gray-600 hover:text-[#1E90FF] no-underline py-1 font-medium">3. The 7 Most Common Polymeric Sand Mistakes (And How to Avoid Them)</a>
              <a href="#how-to-fix-polymeric-sand" class="text-sm text-gray-600 hover:text-[#1E90FF] no-underline py-1 font-medium">4. How to Fix Polymeric Sand Haze</a>
              <a href="#choosing-the-right-polymeric-sand" class="text-sm text-gray-600 hover:text-[#1E90FF] no-underline py-1 font-medium">5. Choosing the Right Polymeric Sand Product</a>
              <a href="#faq" class="text-sm text-gray-600 hover:text-[#1E90FF] no-underline py-1 font-medium">6. FAQ</a>
            </nav>
