                  <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-white mb-4">The Bottom Line</h2>
                  <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
                    <strong class="text-white">Polymeric sand</strong> is straightforward when the sequence is followed exactly and unforgiving when it is not. Fill the joints fully, sweep the paver faces completely clean, blow the surface off with a leaf blower, and only then activate with water in light repeated passes rather than a soak.
                  </p>
                  <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed">
